    "created_at": "2019-03-26T23:25:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-26T23:25:59Z",
    "body": "> Capturing and at target are always performed.\r\n\r\nMaybe we need `capturing` flag in `EventInit` which disables capturing phase as well. It is fundamentally weird that you can't dispatch an event within a component without it being observable outside of it since that leaks the implementation details of a component.",
